   "lid": "u_x = 16 x^2 (1 - x)^2 on y = 1 (REGULARIZED lid, zero at the corners, P1 nodal interpolation at the lid vertices); u = 0 on the other walls",
   "reference": "F2a Taylor-Hood P2/P1 solution on N = 128 (P2 nodal interpolation of the same lid), Re continuation 10... Re",
